(* fs-records-s2b bound K_r = 2: two attacker-scheduled Beacon receive
   attempts after the finish.  Used for the witnesses that need two
   receives (C5a, C5b) and for C-FAILMUT, the control of C5b. *)
expand FS_S2B_RECV_STEP(FsS2bRecv2, FsS2bRecvStop).
expand FS_S2B_RECV_STEP(FsS2bRecv1, FsS2bRecv2).
